@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Monotone data-flow framework — deterministic convergence over BlockCfg

rectangle "CodePropertyGraph\nimmutable node payloads" as CPG #F1F3F5
rectangle "BlockCfg\nblocks · typed edges\nRPO · post-order" as CFG #D3F9D8
rectangle "FactUniverse<T>\nsorted · deduplicated\ndense u32 ids" as FACTS #FFF3BF
rectangle "Lattice\nbottom · join · leq" as LATTICE #E5DBFF
rectangle "DataflowAnalysis\ndirection · confluence\nboundary · block/edge transfer" as ANALYSIS #DBE4FF
rectangle "LoopForest\nheader evidence" as LOOPS #C3FAE8
rectangle "SolverConfig\nvisit cap · widening threshold\nnarrowing passes" as CONFIG #FFE8CC
rectangle "deterministic worklist\nRPO forward · PO backward\nmin-priority BlockId tie-break" as SOLVER #FCC2D7
rectangle "DataflowSolution\nbefore · after · visits\nstate_at replay" as RESULT #C3FAE8
rectangle "AnalysisError::\nIterationLimitExceeded" as ERROR #FFE3E3

CPG --> CFG : block_cfg(function)
CPG --> ANALYSIS : read-only transfer context
FACTS --> LATTICE : domain width / identity
CFG --> SOLVER
LATTICE --> ANALYSIS : Domain
ANALYSIS --> SOLVER
LOOPS --> SOLVER : widening only at headers
CONFIG --> SOLVER
SOLVER --> RESULT : fixed point
SOLVER --> ERROR : next extraction would exceed cap

note bottom of RESULT
  Forward state_at returns before(node).
  Backward state_at returns after(node).
  Solving never mutates the CPG.
end note

legend right
  |= colour |= role |
  |<#F1F3F5>| immutable source graph |
  |<#D3F9D8>| block control-flow substrate |
  |<#FFF3BF>| canonical fact identity |
  |<#E5DBFF>| abstract domain algebra |
  |<#DBE4FF>| client transfer semantics |
  |<#C3FAE8>| loop evidence / public result |
  |<#FFE8CC>| resource and convergence policy |
  |<#FCC2D7>| deterministic solver |
  |<#FFE3E3>| bounded failure |
endlegend
@enduml
